  "description": "\"Fuji's recreation leader, the Absolute, gets an urban makeover in the Absolute City. On the City you'll find Shimano Nexus roller brakes, which provide consistent stopping power under any conditions and require little maintenance. The front hub on most models is a Shimano Nexus Dynamo hub that powers front and rear, switch-operated lights, and the drivetrain, either with a 9-speed derailleur or a 7-speed internal hub, is easy to use. Fat, puncture-protected tires, front and rear fenders and a spring-clamp rear rack make the Absolute City a great urban choice. \"",
